{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6d2ade3c867f7e3c30f130354fb715fb.poster.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6d2ade3c867f7e3c30f130354fb715fb.webm?t=1771236943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/48c910bd2cf37f4983d54ced89cacc89.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=68 /></span>Once a year, the Paintress wakes and paints upon her monolith. Paints her cursed number. And everyone past that age turns to smoke and fades away. Year by year, that number ticks down and more of us are erased. Tomorrow she\u2019ll wake and paint \u201c33.\u201d And tomorrow we depart on our final mission - Destroy the Paintress, so she can never paint death again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Expedition 33.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 is a ground-breaking turn-based RPG with unique real-time mechanics, making battles more immersive and addictive than ever. Explore a fantasy world inspired by Belle \u00c9poque France in which you battle devastating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/ab5b88e5bf9ce1f2f9dd8d0d38784cee.poster.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/ab5b88e5bf9ce1f2f9dd8d0d38784cee.webm?t=1771236943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/bad80897bc5c4198475f3355af4213f2.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=68 /></span>In this evolution of JRPGs, real-time actions enhance the heart of turn-based combat. Craft unique builds for your Expeditioners that fit your playstyle via gear, stats, skills, and character synergies. Open an active dimension in combat - dodge, parry, and counter in real time, chain combos by mastering attack rhythms, and target enemy weak points using a free aim system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6c60128dacdac672ae90d333a93e66bc.poster.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6c60128dacdac672ae90d333a93e66bc.webm?t=1771236943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/57e9dc9984c8c09c4a6692be925dab1f.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only one year left to live, join Gustave, Maelle, and their fellow Expeditioners as they embark upon a desperate quest to break the Paintress\u2019 cycle of death. Follow the trail of previous expeditions and discover their fate. Get to know the members of Expedition 33 as they learn to work together against impossible odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6cb7b05eb03c20e77a87ab84837efede.poster.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6cb7b05eb03c20e77a87ab84837efede.webm?t=1771236943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/0e13d95584acbad7079ed250f0fd7ae2.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an enchanting realm populated by surreal adversaries. Wander through breathtaking landscapes, from the Island of Visages to the Forgotten Battlefield, discovering secrets and hidden quests along the way. Find allies of fortune in creatures of legend. Recruit special companions to access new travel methods and discover secret areas in the World Map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the debut game from Sandfall Interactive, fully realized in Unreal Engine 5 with stunning graphics and a heartbreaking soundtrack.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lumi\u00e8re","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1903340/6c78c7b969521de396e116d62341c83049fbfb1e.jpg"},{"name":"Spring Meadows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1903340/1a8491fdfa5b1c18a2b9426b19a7ea7a60a681df.jpg"},{"name":"Flying Waters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1903340/3d3cea948ddf6252f2c24b7541c77658010f561a.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient Sanctuary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1903340/4548f4272aaf21ecb876f593fe06fbe510bcd269.jpg"},{"name":"Gestral Village","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1903340/e9dda1cb57a4908b9af16371e31ea95a48d556ff.jpg"},{"name":"Esquie's Nest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1903340/15be0150a56427580fa46835f9aae5a1fbe0226d.jpg"},{"name":"Stone Wave Cliffs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1903340/0c93c5dd809f9a0c17756b6149163937e90c193b.jpg"},{"name":"Forgotten Battlefield","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1903340/f481fc1616e2404af6b1ad739b480250eeb9bb61.jpg"},{"name":"Monoco's Station","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1903340/182b62114c63c8fb0f09c114fe13b22e0a6172ae.jpg"},{"name":"Old Lumi\u00e8re","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1903340/42a1ff184366183a572499289529c5faad5ce9c7.jpg"}],"total":55},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1903340?t=1771236943","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771236943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/001d4a5d81e4bb9055b789240e78e04ef6e6da38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771236943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/001d4a5d81e4bb9055b789240e78e04ef6e6da38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771236943","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"The game features depictions of violence, blood and suicide, and imagery that some players may find disturbing. The game contains revealing outfits and light/stylistic partial nudity."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/3be3a617ffa068e69f55f62a1ca1414b.avif?t=1771236943\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras_big/3be3a617ffa068e69f55f62a1ca1414b.webp?t=1771236943 width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Deluxe Edition includes:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 Base Game<br></li><li>The \u201cFlowers\u201d Collection - Six outfits and hairstyles inspired by the Flowers of Lumi\u00e8re, along with six additional \u201cGommage\u201d outfit variations. One for each playable character.<br></li><li>\u201cClair\u201d - A custom outfit for Maelle<br></li><li>\u201cObscur\u201d - A custom outfit for Gustave</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6d2ade3c867f7e3c30f130354fb715fb.poster.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6d2ade3c867f7e3c30f130354fb715fb.webm?t=1771236943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/48c910bd2cf37f4983d54ced89cacc89.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=68 /></span>Once a year, the Paintress wakes and paints upon her monolith. Paints her cursed number. And everyone past that age turns to smoke and fades away. Year by year, that number ticks down and more of us are erased. Tomorrow she\u2019ll wake and paint \u201c33.\u201d And tomorrow we depart on our final mission - Destroy the Paintress, so she can never paint death again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Expedition 33.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 is a ground-breaking turn-based RPG with unique real-time mechanics, making battles more immersive and addictive than ever. Explore a fantasy world inspired by Belle \u00c9poque France in which you battle devastating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/ab5b88e5bf9ce1f2f9dd8d0d38784cee.poster.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/ab5b88e5bf9ce1f2f9dd8d0d38784cee.webm?t=1771236943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/bad80897bc5c4198475f3355af4213f2.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=68 /></span>In this evolution of JRPGs, real-time actions enhance the heart of turn-based combat. Craft unique builds for your Expeditioners that fit your playstyle via gear, stats, skills, and character synergies. Open an active dimension in combat - dodge, parry, and counter in real time, chain combos by mastering attack rhythms, and target enemy weak points using a free aim system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6c60128dacdac672ae90d333a93e66bc.poster.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6c60128dacdac672ae90d333a93e66bc.webm?t=1771236943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/57e9dc9984c8c09c4a6692be925dab1f.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only one year left to live, join Gustave, Maelle, and their fellow Expeditioners as they embark upon a desperate quest to break the Paintress\u2019 cycle of death. Follow the trail of previous expeditions and discover their fate. Get to know the members of Expedition 33 as they learn to work together against impossible odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6cb7b05eb03c20e77a87ab84837efede.poster.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/6cb7b05eb03c20e77a87ab84837efede.webm?t=1771236943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/extras/0e13d95584acbad7079ed250f0fd7ae2.avif?t=1771236943\" width=780 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an enchanting realm populated by surreal adversaries. Wander through breathtaking landscapes, from the Island of Visages to the Forgotten Battlefield, discovering secrets and hidden quests along the way. Find allies of fortune in creatures of legend. Recruit special companions to access new travel methods and discover secret areas in the World Map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the debut game from Sandfall Interactive, fully realized in Unreal Engine 5 with stunning graphics and a heartbreaking soundtrack.</p>","developers":["Sandfall Interactive"],"dlc":[3228520,3405480,3873750,4227900],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903340/be3305b02d4db0dffa3458537118423bf2792d7e/header.jpg?t=1771236943","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Developed by Sandfall Interactive. Published by Kepler Interactive. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":91,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/clair-obscur-expedition-33?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1903340/876247/5c4709c3a98d932003a6b85bd5e4bfcd6a777e7a/1748581603/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745478082","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1903340/876247/5c4709c3a98d932003a6b85bd5e4bfcd6a777e7a/1748581603/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745478082","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1903340/876247/5c4709c3a98d932003a6b85bd5e4bfcd6a777e7a/1748581603/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745478082","id":257129803,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257129803/a409d62da478b6b9fdceeb05a1281805fe7a0dae/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745478082"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/19